eproduce*\n\n1. Build Vim on CentOS 7\n2. Add this in `vimrc`:\n\n```\nset termguicolors\nlet let g:terminal_ansi_colors = [\"#000000\", \"#F92672\", \"#BAED00\", \"#EBCE00\", \"#00BEF3\", \"#BAA0F0\", \"#71C0ED\", \"#EAEAEA\", \"#333333\", \"#FA397E\", \"#C1F600\", \"#FFE000\", \"#00C2F9\", \"#C6ABFF\", \"#79CEFF\", \"#FFFFFF\"]\n```\n\n3. Start Vim\n4. Execute `:terminal`\n5. You will see a terminal window which has no colors\n\n*Expected behaviour*\n\n`:terminal` has colors even if `termguicolors` and `g:terminal_ansi_colors` are set on CentOS 7.\n\n*Operating system*\n\nCentOS 7\n\n*Version of Vim*\n\nVim 8.2.3644\n\n*Logs and stack traces*\n*Note*\n\nThis issue was caused by 87fd0924e2d85213cc111ee7a5122f92216a37c7 (refs. \u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim/issues/9058#issuecomment-974672940|vim/vim#9058 (comment)\u003e). And \u003chttps://github.com/Milly|@Milly\u003e has already resolved this issue on \u003chttps://github.com/Milly/vim/commit/3adfde3cf17e3d56acab3153464408a8c979b580|Milly/vim@3adfde3\u003e. Thanks so much!!","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/vim/vim|vim/vim\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png","ts":1637655591}],"parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Zl+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c5cf9e14-b307-4e00-a428-3047dd7845b0","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"PR出しました！","ts":"1637655703.110700","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=HC"}]},{"client_msg_id":"355a56df-6bee-4dfe-9308-3c01b960b704","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"早い！ ありがとうございます!!","ts":"1637655714.110900","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"NFs5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d2895041-73c7-4b9b-8250-a35c16ebd1ce","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"ちなみに `set tgc` は関係なくて `notgc` でも正しく動作してなかったような？","ts":"1637655797.111100","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"3FJen"}]},{"client_msg_id":"88cec740-cabf-412b-bb68-d194d711799a","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"おっと、そうなんですね:sweat_drops:","ts":"1637655816.111300","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lXx2S"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14e465fc-ab13-4b3b-bf8d-190b1c88c08d","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"勘違いすみません","ts":"1637655835.111500","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"j2M"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df1cf954-4006-4857-8cbe-45f7abc64496","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"あ、いや tgc じゃないとそもそも rgb じゃないから g:terminal_ansi_colors は使われないんだっけ。","ts":"1637655874.111700","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JdN"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c2bd942-609f-4895-b649-23e24b33c28f","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"そう思い込んでいました","ts":"1637655894.111900","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"0w3B"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b3d2ebe-80ea-4b82-8e8a-051103f418cf","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"（一応確認中です）","ts":"1637655960.112100","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"M55"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e8b0fe4f-003b-4868-8140-fe54c141714d","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"（`tgc` 関係なかったらIssueも直す）","ts":"1637655979.112300","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tN2"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19d7c457-cb0c-44c4-9cdb-c56425ac9ab9","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"確認してみたら `tgc` 関係なさそうでした:sweat_drops: Issueも直します:bow:","ts":"1637656085.112500","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"sumi","count":1,"users":["UBNPMJJGM"]},{"name":"+1","count":1,"users":["UP6PA1UBE"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"piGc"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b5e660b2-01d3-469e-893b-c506fbd2861d","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"あと、色がつかないのは基本16色に対してだけで256色パレットとフルカラーの色は出るので。\n適当なスクリプトを書いた方が再現させる人にやさしいかと。\nこんな\n```bash -c 'for ((i=0;i\u0026lt;16;i++)); do printf \"\\e[38;5;%dm %02d \\e[m\" $i $i; done'```","ts":"1637657577.112900","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","edited":{"user":"UP6PA1UBE","ts":"1637657778.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"GgRWY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"df73dccc-cb44-46dd-b68a-4624729dc3d8","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"あー、仰るとおりですね。同じCentOS 7でも色が出るケースと出ないケースがあるなと思っていて、そのへんの情報を補いたいと思ってたんですが、そうか、カラーパレット書き出すような感じにすればよかったですね:bulb: 言われてみれば、Vim外のターミナルで色がおかしいときはそれやりますね。想像力不足でした。フィードバック感謝です:pray:","ts":"1637666128.113200","thread_ts":"1637653467.107800","edited":{"user":"UBNPMJJGM","ts":"1637666145.000000"},"parent_user_id":"UP6PA1UBE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"HWA6"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d857281-b3fb-4eba-86f9-f5de9f910f5d","type":"message","user":"UBNPMJJGM","text":"相変わらず仕事が早い","ts